msgstr "Orden ka endpoint la koñesidu."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:33
msgid ""
"The order can't be placed or changed: sold-out items, a total that doesn't "
"match the menu prices, a branch that is closed, or a status change that "
"isn't allowed."
msgstr ""
"Orden labele halo ka muda: item ne'ebé hotu ona, totál ne'ebé la tuir presu "
"menu, filial ne'ebé taka, ka mudansa estadu ne'ebé la permite."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:34
msgid "Too many requests; wait a minute."
msgstr "Pedidu barak liu; hein minutu ida."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:39
msgid "The branches this key can use (only live branches)."
msgstr "Filial sira ne'ebé xave ne'e bele uza (filial ativu de'it)."

#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:46
msgid ""
