#: templates/dashboard/api_docs.html:85
msgid ""
"Optional: your own order number. Sending the same reference again returns "
"the existing order instead of creating a duplicate, so retries are safe."
msgstr ""
"Opsionál: ita-nia númeru orden rasik. Haruka referénsia hanesan fali sei fó "
"fila orden ne'ebé iha ona, la kria duplikadu, nune'e koko fali seguru."

