msgid "Ordering API for your website, apps & delivery partners"
msgstr "API orden ba ita-nia website, aplikasaun & parseiru entrega"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:131
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "Hahú"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:139
msgid "Are you a customer?"
msgstr "Ita kliente?"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:140
msgid "To order, please scan the QR code on your table."
msgstr "Atu pede, favór scan kódigu QR iha ita-nia meza."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:147 templates/storefront/home.html:169
msgid "User manual"
msgstr "Manuál uzuáriu"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:148
msgid ""
"A step-by-step guide with screenshots for owners, managers, kitchen staff, "
"waiters and cashiers."
msgstr ""
"Matadalan pasu ba pasu ho foto ekran ba na'in, jerente, funsionáriu kozinha, "
"serbidór no kaixa."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:159
msgid "Hardware notice"
msgstr "Avizu kona-ba ekipamentu"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:160
msgid ""
"QR Menu is a software service. We do not sell hardware such as computers, "
"cash drawers or receipt printers."
msgstr ""
"QR Menu mak servisu software. Ami la faan ekipamentu hanesan komputadór, "
"gaveta osan ka imprimidora resibu."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:161
msgid ""
"However, if your restaurant or café needs any of this equipment, we're happy "
"to help. We can provide a quotation for the hardware and installation, so "
"you get everything set up and ready to use with QR Menu."
msgstr ""
"Maibé, se ita-nia restaurante ka kafé presiza ekipamentu sira ne'e, ami "
"kontente atu ajuda. Ami bele fó kotasaun ba ekipamentu no instalasaun, atu "
"buat hotu prepara ona no prontu atu uza ho QR Menu."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:162
msgid ""
"Hello! I'd like a quotation for hardware (computer, cash drawer, receipt "
"printer) and installation for QR Menu."
msgstr ""
"Olá! Ha'u hakarak kotasaun ba ekipamentu (komputadór, gaveta osan, "
"imprimidora resibu) no instalasaun ba QR Menu."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:163
msgid "Contact us on WhatsApp for a free quote"
msgstr "Kontaktu ami iha WhatsApp atu hetan kotasaun gratuitu"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:167
#, python-format
msgid "Hello! I'd like to know more about %(name)s."
msgstr "Olá! Ha'u hakarak hatene liu tan kona-ba %(name)s."

#: templates/storefront/home.html:169 templates/storefront/terms.html:4
#: templates/storefront/terms.html:14
msgid "Terms of service"
msgstr "Termu servisu"

#: templates/storefront/home.html:177
msgid "Chat with us on WhatsApp"
msgstr "Ko'alia ho ami iha WhatsApp"

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:15
msgid "Last updated: 9 October 2026"
msgstr "Atualiza ikus: 9 Outubru 2026"

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:17
msgid "1. The service"
msgstr "1. Servisu"

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:18
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s provides QR code menus, table ordering and restaurant management "
"tools to food businesses (\"you\"). By registering, you accept these terms "
"on behalf of your business."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s fornese menu ho kódigu QR, orden iha meza no ferramenta jestaun ba "
"negósiu ai-han (\"ita\"). Ho rejistu, ita aseita termu hirak ne'e ba ita-nia "
"negósiu."

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:20
msgid "2. Your account"
msgstr "2. Ita-nia konta"

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:21
msgid ""
"You must give correct information about your business and keep your login "
"details secret. You are responsible for everything done with your account "
"and your staff accounts. We may ask you to verify your business (for example "
"with your business registration or tax number) before you can use some "
"features."
msgstr ""
"Ita tenke fó informasaun loos kona-ba ita-nia negósiu no rai ita-nia detalle "
"login sekretu. Ita responsável ba buat hotu ne'ebé halo ho ita-nia konta no "
"konta ekipa. Ami bele husu verifika ita-nia negósiu (ez. ho rejistu negósiu "
"ka númeru impostu) antes ita bele uza funsaun balun."

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:23
msgid "3. Branches"
msgstr "3. Filial sira"

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:24
msgid ""
"All branches in one account must be owned and operated by the same business, "
"under the same business registration and brand name."
msgstr ""
"Filial hotu iha konta ida tenke na'in no jere husi negósiu hanesan, ho "
"rejistu negósiu no naran marka hanesan."

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:24
msgid ""
"Each new branch is reviewed by our team before it is activated. A branch "
"that belongs to a different business is not allowed: we may suspend it, or "
"move it to a separate account that is billed separately."
msgstr ""
"Ami-nia ekipa revee filial foun ida-idak antes ativa. Filial husi negósiu "
"seluk la permite: ami bele suspende ka muda ba konta separadu ne'ebé fatura "
"separadu."

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:26
msgid "4. Plans and payment"
msgstr "4. Planu no pagamentu"

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:27
msgid ""
"Plans are billed monthly in US dollars. Each plan includes a fixed number of "
"branches; extra branches are a monthly add-on. If an invoice is not paid "
"after the grace period, ordering is switched off until it is paid. Prices "
"may change with 30 days' notice."
msgstr ""
"Planu sira fatura kada fulan iha dólar amerikanu. Planu ida-idak inklui "
"númeru filial fixu; filial extra mak add-on kada fulan. Se fatura la selu "
"depois períodu toleránsia, orden sei mate to'o selu. Presu bele muda ho "
"avizu loron 30."

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:29
msgid "5. Your data"
msgstr "5. Ita-nia dadus"

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:30
msgid ""
"Your menus, orders and revenue records belong to you. We use them only to "
"provide the service and keep each branch's data separate. We don't sell your "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Ita-nia menu, orden no rejistu rendimentu mak ita-nian. Ami uza de'it atu fó "
"servisu no rai dadus filial ida-idak separadu. Ami la fa'an ita-nia dadus."

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:32
msgid "6. Acceptable use"
msgstr "6. Uza ne'ebé permite"

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:33
msgid ""
"Don't use the service for anything illegal, to mislead customers, or to "
"disrupt the platform. We may suspend accounts that break these terms."
msgstr ""
"Labele uza servisu ba buat ilegál, atu bosok kliente, ka atu estraga "
"plataforma. Ami bele suspende konta ne'ebé viola termu hirak ne'e."

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:35
msgid "7. Liability"
msgstr "7. Responsabilidade"

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:36
msgid ""
"We work hard to keep the service available, but we can't guarantee it will "
"always be uninterrupted. To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for "
"indirect losses such as lost sales."
msgstr ""
"Ami servisu maka'as atu servisu disponível, maibé ami labele garante katak "
"nunka para. Tuir lei permite, ami la responsável ba lakon indiretu hanesan "
"fa'an ne'ebé lakon."

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:38
msgid "8. Contact"
msgstr "8. Kontaktu"

#: templates/storefront/terms.html:39
msgid "Questions about these terms:"
msgstr "Pergunta kona-ba termu hirak ne'e:"

